error[E1001]: `xs[1].len` is used here after its value moved away
  --> mem:///main.lu:12:5
   |
 9 |     var t = move xs[i]
   |                  ----- `xs[i]` moved here
...
12 |     xs[1].len
   |     ^^^^^^^^^ used after the move
   |
   = note: `xs[1].len` may reach the moved `xs[i]`: an index that is not a literal is one place
     with every other index of its container [mem.model.place.elem]. Distinct literal indices
     stay usable.
   = note: re-initializing the place (assigning to it) also makes it usable again.
help: to keep the original, copy it at the move
   |
 9 |     var t = move copy xs[i]
   |
